{"b":"Ps","c":56,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Be merciful unto me, O God: for man would swallow me up; he fighting daily oppresseth me.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O God”."},"x":[["1Sam.29.4",6,"r"],["Ps.69.13",5,"r"],["Ps.69.16",5,"r"],["Ps.16.1",5,"r"],["Ps.31.9",5,"r"],["Ps.59.1",5,"r"],["Ps.60.1",4,"r"],["Ps.27.2",4,"r"],["Lam.2.16",3,"r"],["Lam.2.2",3,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Mine enemies would daily swallow me up: for they be many that fight against me, O thou most High.","it":[[33,35],[44,51]],"x":[["Ps.57.3",4,"w"],["Ps.118.10",4,"r"],["Ps.118.12",4,"r"],["Ps.9.2",3,"w"],["Acts.4.25",3,"r"],["Acts.4.27",3,"r"],["Ps.92.1",3,"w"],["Ps.92.8",3,"w"],["Mic.6.6",3,"w"],["Rev.16.14",3,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"What time I am afraid, I will trust in thee.","x":[["Ps.34.4",64,"r"],["1Sam.30.6",25,"r"],["2Cor.7.5",21,"r"],["2Cor.7.6",21,"r"],["Ps.55.4",19,"r"],["Ps.55.5",19,"r"],["2Chr.20.3",14,"r"],["2Cor.1.8",14,"r"],["2Cor.1.10",14,"w"],["Ps.11.1",13,"w"]]},{"n":4,"t":"In God I will praise his word, in God I have put my trust; I will not fear what flesh can do unto me.","x":[["Ps.118.6",34,"w"],["Heb.13.6",34,"w"],["Rom.8.31",26,"w"],["Rom.8.39",26,"r"],["Ps.27.1",24,"w"],["Isa.41.10",20,"w"],["Ps.56.10",14,"e"],["Ps.56.11",14,"e"],["Luke.12.4",12,"w"],["Luke.12.5",12,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"Every day they wrest my words: all their thoughts are against me for evil.","it":[[50,53]],"x":[["Luke.11.54",8,"r"],["Matt.22.15",8,"r"],["Isa.29.20",7,"r"],["Isa.29.21",7,"r"],["Ps.41.7",7,"r"],["2Pet.3.16",6,"w"],["1Sam.18.21",5,"r"],["John.2.19",4,"r"],["Luke.22.3",4,"r"],["Luke.22.6",4,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"They gather themselves together, they hide themselves, they mark my steps, when they wait for my soul.","x":[["Ps.71.10",7,"w"],["Ps.59.3",7,"w"],["Ps.140.2",5,"r"],["Acts.23.12",4,"w"],["Acts.23.14",4,"r"],["Luke.20.20",3,"w"],["Acts.4.5",2,"r"],["Acts.4.6",2,"r"],["Matt.26.3",2,"r"],["Matt.26.4",2,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Shall they escape by iniquity? in thine anger cast do